{%- comment -%}
  agentic-faq.liquid — product Q&A block (when the product has custom.faq_fr / faq_en) + FAQPage
  JSON-LD. Store-level answers (2026-10-15 UX pass) stay JSON-LD only:

  The visible answers now live in ONE accordion list with the store info (templates/product.json,
  block `pdp_info`): Livraison, Retours, Garantie, Montage, Entretien, Paiement sécurisé. Before,
  this snippet rendered its own "Questions fréquentes" list in a different font right above that
  list, and Livraison / Retours were said twice. The markup below reuses the SAME locale strings
  (faq.a2…a5) that pdp_info shows, so the structured data still matches visible content.
  q1 (dimensions) is dropped: its answer only pointed at the description.

  Usage : {% render 'agentic-faq', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  GEO 2026-10-18 : le filtre `t` échappe l'HTML (d'idée → d&#39;idée). Le JSON-LD n'est pas décodé
  par les robots, donc on remet les caractères avant `json` (&amp; en dernier).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign q2 = 'faq.q2' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign a2 = 'faq.a2' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign q3 = 'faq.q3' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign a3 = 'faq.a3' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign q4 = 'faq.q4' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign a4 = 'faq.a4' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign q5 = 'faq.q5' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'
  assign a5 = 'faq.a5' | t | replace: '&#39;', "'" | replace: '&quot;', '"' | replace: '&lt;', '<' | replace: '&gt;', '>' | replace: '&amp;', '&'

  comment
    Product-specific Q&A (pilot 2026-11): JSON metafields custom.faq_fr / custom.faq_en = [{q, a}],
    written from the product's own data only. Shown visibly AND listed first in the FAQPage, so the
    markup always matches what the page shows. es/pa have no Q&A yet: nothing product-specific there.
  endcomment
  assign lc_pfaq = nil
  assign lc_pfaq_title = 'Questions sur ce produit'
  if request.locale.iso_code == 'fr'
    assign lc_pfaq = product.metafields.custom.faq_fr.value
  elsif request.locale.iso_code == 'en'
    assign lc_pfaq = product.metafields.custom.faq_en.value
    assign lc_pfaq_title = 'Questions about this product'
  endif
-%}
{%- if lc_pfaq != blank and lc_pfaq.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="lc-pfaq" aria-labelledby="lc-pfaq-title-{{ product.id }}">
    <h2 id="lc-pfaq-title-{{ product.id }}" class="lc-pfaq__title">{{ lc_pfaq_title }}</h2>
    {%- for item in lc_pfaq -%}
      <details class="lc-pfaq__item"{% if forloop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary class="lc-pfaq__q">{{ item.q | escape }}</summary>
        <p class="lc-pfaq__a">{{ item.a | escape }}</p>
      </details>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </section>
  <style>
    .lc-pfaq { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .lc-pfaq__title { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
    .lc-pfaq__item { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .12); }
    .lc-pfaq__item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), .12); }
    .lc-pfaq__q { cursor: pointer; padding: .8rem 0; font-weight: 600; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
    .lc-pfaq__q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .lc-pfaq__q::after { content: '+'; font-weight: 400; }
    .lc-pfaq__item[open] .lc-pfaq__q::after { content: '−'; }
    .lc-pfaq__q:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground)); outline-offset: 2px; }
    .lc-pfaq__a { margin: 0 0 .9rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org/",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- if lc_pfaq != blank -%}
    {%- for item in lc_pfaq %}
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ item.q | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ item.a | json }} } },
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif %}
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q2 | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a2 | json }} } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q5 | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a5 | json }} } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q4 | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a4 | json }} } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": {{ q3 | json }}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a3 | json }} } }
  ]
}
</script>
